{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫（TVB）節目《萬眾同心公益金》今晚（6月6日）播出，除了有歌手和善長人翁支持，不少社會名流更現身獻唱，實在難得！</p><figure><img alt=\"精神！（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140061057453133824135246.jpeg/3cVFRkWHp9p05NlEysUz_DfEAbpzYzCyukRO5LpETuQ\"/><figcaption>精神！（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"新男女團SURFIVE、魔音女團大曬冷。（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140060994056228864927804.jpeg/FR_21MrbA47_yMA7XSukpVF3CUpvZwtGmiBRBJogUQQ\"/><figcaption>新男女團SURFIVE、魔音女團大曬冷。（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>新男女團SURFIVE、魔音女團大曬冷</p><p>新出道的「魔音女團」喬美莎、倪樂琳、倪嘉雯、盧映彤、宋宛穎、莊子璇 6位成員成軍後，今晚節目《萬眾同心公益金》可說是她們的「處女秀」表演，除了有《魔音女團》節目主題曲《Lucky Star》外，更有新歌《Turn My Magic On》。昔日隊友們，鄧凱文、穎喬、俞可程、廖慧儀等亦在後排伴舞撐場。同場新男團SURFIVE 冼靖峰、文佐匡、黃奕斌伴等人跳唱《Popstar》之外亦一同跳唱《Lucky Star》，場面十分壯觀。</p><figure><img alt=\"魔音女團首次登台，真係跳得好！（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140061134490308608724518.jpeg/27kllKac1LFNVdSAaxrYkMwcWhn_0kC0t3Ka07dymtM\"/><figcaption>魔音女團首次登台，真係跳得好！（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"魔音女團首次登台，真係跳得好！（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140061131931652096495726.jpeg/WTSKk6gsMlLFg6lWuqf6stY_MjuRGB1mj_OIb4_ziG8\"/><figcaption>魔音女團首次登台，真係跳得好！（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"莊子璇果然係顏值擔當。（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140061129687568384438201.jpeg/CSoUfTULgUa_ksPi_zZW5dbBW_0VYkSYXGv-Mlxr_jI\"/><figcaption>莊子璇果然係顏值擔當。（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"喬美莎條腿好長。（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140061126856282112078123.jpeg/3oAqVaSbxpmEZO2g55dD4PjMqYysYmVbNcR_aDXEf2g\"/><figcaption>喬美莎條腿好長。（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"喬美莎條腿好長。（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140061137011216384591874.jpeg/Yl8ZNTxMK6eKhxZ6do1RIzsOFqmYE4dafGuoInxrqCI\"/><figcaption>喬美莎條腿好長。（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"倪樂琳跳得都好好。（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140061134809075712530942.jpeg/2isLrrh8HQb49j9zgRV6pu1yqdJqLpV7A-xfHwPsXx8\"/><figcaption>倪樂琳跳得都好好。（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"。（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140061132476911616958271.jpeg/MYvYr2BJkeDqogXwMvz1Yvyf-vcsRubVJYRdUCWEXVA\"/><figcaption>。（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"魔音女團表演合格！（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140061130241216512502134.jpeg/frVR-EGMSuPuBQkRF-OQKG16eXFG15QlebsHRHm7B0Q\"/><figcaption>魔音女團表演合格！（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"新男團SURFIVE伴舞（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140061127707725824809246.jpeg/TbD0eeoJOAIF1BIhR4SU5UJ6cvkdBerlwQd2GsEHdho\"/><figcaption>新男團SURFIVE伴舞（《萬眾同心公益金》截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-06T14:56:35.066180+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":560,"images":11,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}